msgstr "Specify the original language and the desired translation languages."

#: includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:498
msgid "Originalsprache, Zielsprachen und Auto-Weiterleitung werden im Deepglot-Dashboard verwaltet und hier nur angezeigt."
msgstr "The source language, target languages, and automatic redirect are managed in the Deepglot dashboard and are only displayed here."

